    # game/script-ch1.rpy:265
    old "Here's a small tip before you start: I always say clicks are like little spells."
    new "Aquí tienes un pequeño consejo antes de empezar: siempre digo que los clics son como pequeños hechizos."

    # game/script-ch1.rpy:267
    old "The more you believe in them, the more they can give you."
